            <title>[IGNITE-15346] Iterator of the ClientCacheQueryCursor can be closed during serialization. </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15346</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
